Adds the stellux WSI platform, whose surfaces wrap stlxwin windows, and
offers VK_STLX_surface from NVK. Only the GPU whose buffers stlxdm takes
can present, from every queue family, so the Stellux nvkmd records the N of
the /dev/gpuN it opened and NVK hands it to the WSI device. The window's
configured size is the only extent, and a dead connection or stlxdm taking
no GPU buffers loses the surface. The platform creates no swapchain:
creation fails with VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED.

